                                "sense_id": "817b6215-d676-35ed-955f-9516920457b3",
                                "text": "“And ready the langrel shot,” he yelled to Smithy.\nIsabel turned to Cutter, fear sparking within her. “What is langrel?” “A type of cannon shot meant to damage sails and masts. Never fear, milady. He means only to cripple them.”"
